# Build context of the three images (T-039; Dockerfile.api, Dockerfile.worker,
# apps/web/Dockerfile, all built from the repository root). Nothing secret,
# local or generated goes in: no .env files, no git history, no installed
# packages or build output, no reports or sources the images do not use.
# Env files in any directory (a local apps/web/.env would reach the web
# image: review round 1, L3); only the committed example comes back.
.git
.github
.claude
.impeccable
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
bin
checks
sources
docs
planning
openapi
testdata
db/tests
apps/web-e2e
deploy
